+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines a 30-day refund window through `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+For refund disputes, determine whether the request falls within that window only when the relevant dates are supported by available evidence. The window does not itself establish approval or authorize issuing a refund.
+
+The billing implementation does not establish invoice lookup, correction, issuance, payment-status behavior, or authority to alter an invoice. Answer invoice questions only from available evidence and escalate requests whose facts or required action cannot be established.

